# Out-of-source build tree created by hpcg-lab/harness/build-hpcg.sh
# Every per-architecture build directory, not just build/. One filesystem here
# is shared between an x86 node and an aarch64 one, so builds are kept apart by
# name -- build-rubin, build-patrick-rubin, build-i64mix-rubin -- and each was
# offering its object tree to `git add` while build/ alone was ignored.
build*/
